# The .vsix holds only what runs and what the stores show. Everything else
# (src/, test/ and its fixtures, scripts/, vendor/wisply-mcp/, out/,
# node_modules/, source maps, configs) stays out. test/vsix.test.mjs checks
# the list that `vsce ls` prints.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!SECURITY.md
!dist/extension.js
!server/wisply-mcp.mjs
!vendor/SOURCE.json
!media/icon.png
!skills/*/SKILL.md
